{{letter|ru}}

# {{Cyrl-def|ru|letter|1|а}}

=====See also=====
{{list:Cyrillic script letters/ru}}

====Noun====
{{ru-noun||n-in|-}}

# {{Cyrl-def|ru|name|А|а}}
#: {{uxi|ru|Де́ти научи́лись писа́ть бу́кву '''а'''.|The children have learnt to write the letter '''A'''.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|Ты до́лжен вы́учить уро́к от '''а''' до я.|You must learn the lesson [[from A to Z]].}}
#: {{uxi|ru|Кто сказал '''а''', должен сказать и б.| Having said '''A''', one must also say B (''i.e.'' People must follow through the logical consequences of their remarks, actions, etc.)}}
# {{Latn-def|ru|name|A|a}}
# ''The sound expressed by the letter A''.
#: {{uxi|ru|В белору́сском языке́ безуда́рный гла́сный '''а''' всегда́ обознача́ется бу́квой '''а'''.|In the Belarusian language, the unstressed '''A''' sound is always written with the letter '''A'''.}}
# The first item in a list of similar items.
#: {{uxi|ru|Я учу́сь в 10'''а''' [деся́том а] кла́ссе.|I study in class 10'''a'''.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|На́м ну́жно купи́ть: '''а''' - хлеб, б - молоко, в - масло.|We need to buy: '''a''') bread, b) milk, c) butter.}}
# The first item among those numbered with the same number as a pre-existing one.
#: {{uxi|ru|Ме́жду дома́ми 7 и 8 постро́или но́вые дома́ 7'''а''' [семь-а] и 7б [семь-бэ].|Between numbers 7 and 8, new houses, 7'''a''' and 7b, have been built.}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ru|от а до я}}, {{l|ru|от А до Я}}

=====See also=====
{{list:Cyrillic script letter names/ru}}

====References====
* {{R:ru:Dal}}

===Etymology 2===
{{etymid|ru|but}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|а||and, but}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*a||and, but}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*ō}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*h₁ōd}} (presumed to be the ablative of {{m|ine-pro|*éy|*éy, h₁e}}). Cognate with {{cog|lt|õ||and, but}}.

Possible link with {{cog|lt|ar̃||question particle}}. Compare {{cog|ru|а||and, but}}, {{m|ru|и||and}} and {{m|ru|да||and, but}} with {{cog|lt|ar̃||if, whether}}, {{m|lt|ir̃||and}} and {{m|lt|dár||still, yet}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{qualifier|stressed}} {{ru-IPA}} {{audio|ru|Ru-а.ogg}}
* {{qualifier|unstressed}} {{ru-IPA-manual|[ə]}}
* {{qualifier|unstressed, pre-tonal}} {{ru-IPA-manual|[ɐ]}}

====Conjunction====
{{head|ru|conjunction|cat2=1-letter words}}

# [[but]], [[and]], [[while]], [[although]] {{gl|deviates from the preceding idea in some manner; introduces a new or different meaning, as opposed to {{m|ru|но}}, which usually indicates contrarity}}
#: {{uxi|ru|Сего́дня тепло́, '''а''' вчера́ бы́ло хо́лодно.|It is warm today, '''but/while/although''' yesterday it was cold.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|Э́то не я́блоко, '''а''' гру́ша.|This is not an apple, '''but''' a pear.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|Его́ па́па до́ктор, '''а''' его́ ма́ма учи́тельница.|His father is a doctor '''and/while''' his mother is a teacher.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|Она́ лю́бит му́зыку, '''а''' он предпочита́ет спорт.|She likes music '''while''' he prefers sport.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''А''' что?|How come?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''а''' то|'''or''' else}}
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1964|author=w:ru:Братья Стругацкие<t:{{w|Arkady and Boris Strugatsky}}>|title=w:ru:Трудно быть богом|chapter=3|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=Olena Bormashenko|title2=w:[[Hard to Be a God]]|location2=Chicago|publisher2=w:Chicago Review Press|year2=2014|page2=|pageurl2=|text=Ка́мень был не ка́мень, '''а''' объекти́в телепереда́тчика, и о́бруч был не о́бруч, '''а''' ра́ция.|t=The stone wasn’t a stone '''but''' a camera lens, and the circlet wasn’t a circlet '''but''' a radio transmitter.}}

